      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "\"It ain't just 'changes,' Earl; it's the kind of rot creeping in from the edges, the kind that doesn't belong in our stores.\" \"Exactly, Martha. When they start letting *those* folks in, the whole foundation starts to shake, and you know what comes next.\" \"They don't understand how things work around here, these outsiders. They think they can just waltz in and change what's ours.\"",
